invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_cfg.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: clientCfg (chapulin_cfg.zig) leaves ch_cfg.ticket_age_ms at 0, so C judges every
  ticket as one that arrived this millisecond and offers a stale ticket
  that RFC 9846 section 4.3.11.1 forbids. unit.zig's field-by-field ch_cfg
  test and the stale-ticket rows of loop.zig object.
--- old
    cfg.ticket_age_ms = values.ticket_age_ms;
--- new
    cfg.ticket_age_ms = 0;
